<h2 class="mt-12">Implementation order for a personalization program</h2>
<ol>
<li>Record personalization permission origins in the ESP before sending.</li>
<li>Prove personalization-critical Shopify events — order, cart, refund, support — fire in a test store.</li>
<li>Write personalization suppression and exits before any personalization flow exists.</li>
<li>Pilot personalization with one bounded journey plus holdout measurement.</li>
<li>Thirty days into personalization, score margin and audience health.</li>
<li>Broaden personalization after the pilot survives handoff.</li>
<li>Codify the personalization peak freeze: edits, discounts, volume.</li>
<li>Quarterly, weigh the personalization stack against attributed margin.</li>
<li>For personalization, dusty journeys get archived quarterly.</li>
</ol>
