<h2 class="mt-12">Governance and documentation for personalization</h2>
<div class="overflow-x-auto mb-8"><table>
<thead><tr><th>Practice</th><th>Standard</th><th>Risk it prevents</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Flow ownership</td><td>personalization ownership assigned journey by journey</td><td>Personalization orphans broadcasting stale offers</td></tr>
<tr><td>Naming convention</td><td>Name personalization flows job-first, audience-second</td><td>Personalization audits collapsing at peak</td></tr>
<tr><td>Change log</td><td>personalization-flow history recorded per change</td><td>Personalization regressions without a trail</td></tr>
<tr><td>Access control</td><td>Personalization seats on least privilege</td><td>Stray personalization deletes via broad seats</td></tr>
<tr><td>Quarterly flow review</td><td>Personalization dead branches archived</td><td>personalization cruft raising edit cost</td></tr>
<tr><td>Incident runbook</td><td>personalization kill steps plus alert list</td><td>personalization damage window from missing runbook</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
<h2 class="mt-12">Peak season readiness for personalization</h2>
<ol>
<li>Lock personalization flow edits a full fortnight before peak.</li>
<li>Exercise each personalization flow with live purchase, refund, support tests.</li>
<li>For personalization, confirm buyer and return exclusions hold.</li>
<li>Personalization measurement needs bigger peak holdouts.</li>
<li>Draft personalization SMS quiet-hour and cap rules in advance.</li>
<li>Match personalization plan caps and overage rates to forecast volume.</li>
<li>Staff daily personalization deliverability watch on complaints and bounces.</li>
<li>Personalization undo paths recorded pre-campaign.</li>
</ol>
<p>For personalization, schedule quarter-one review before the first send. Writing personalization suppression rules, discount caps, and escalation paths down in week one saves weeks of peak-season triage and hands newcomers a working personalization playbook.</p>
<p>Close each personalization quarter with a written ledger — personalization sends shipped, suppressions honored, margin retained, failed bets — so personalization vendor decisions rest on one shared evidence file, not scattered memory.</p>
